<title>UK: BNG prices $1.0 billion five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>BNG prices $1.0 billion five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced eariler in Tokyo by joint lead managers ABN AMRO, Goldman Sachs, and Nomura Seurities, has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NV BANK NEDERLANDS GEMEENTEN (BNG)</p>
<p> AMT    $1.0 BLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    08.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.113   PAY DATE    08.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.488    SPREAD	+12 BP</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST/LUX  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  NETHS</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/NL</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.5 PCT U.S. TREASURY DUE MAY 2002</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF DEBT ISSUANCE PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
